WEBVTT

00:15:29.000 --> 00:15:31.976
desperately trying to slow
my heart rate down.

00:15:32.000 --> 00:15:33.652
I was just sitting there thinking,

00:15:33.676 --> 00:15:36.364
"I've got to slow this down.
I'm going to fail."

00:15:36.388 --> 00:15:37.976
And I was getting more nervous.

00:15:38.000 --> 00:15:40.143
And the heart rate
just kept going up and up,

00:15:40.167 --> 00:15:42.053
all the way up to 150 beats.

00:15:44.987 --> 00:15:48.653
Basically it's the same thing that created
my downfall at Lincoln Center.

00:15:48.677 --> 00:15:50.034
It was a waste of O2.

00:15:51.000 --> 00:15:53.524
When I made it to the halfway
mark, at eight minutes,

00:15:53.548 --> 00:15:55.976
I was 100 percent certain

00:15:56.000 --> 00:15:58.143
that I was not going
to be able to make this.

00:15:58.167 --> 00:16:00.312
There was no way for me to do it.